[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-hillbilly 4...Nf6"]
[Name "Hillbilly: 5.d3"]

5. d3 Bg4 { Develops with a tempo: the bishop hits the queen, and White has to deal with it. }
6. Nf3 e6 { The knight is pinned, the bishop is out, and ...e6 can follow. Black has the extra central pawn. }
7. O-O Nc6 { Develops. White's position is passive: no pawn in the centre and a bishop on b3 with nothing to do. } *
